  "name": "Turkish Eggs (Cilbir)",
  "subtitle": "Poached eggs with garlicky yogurt and spiced butter",
  "description": "Warm garlicky yogurt, poached eggs, and fragrant chili butter come together in a savory breakfast dish finished with fresh herbs and jalapeño.",
